Hi Junqi,
That's great. Re the non-zero reproduction buffers - there could be a bug so I'll take a look. Re the 1 g discrepancy, have a look at the way it's calculated in the DEB.R <https://github.com/mrke/NicheMapR/blob/db4c502f32fb2e316aaee40d5ae36402c7512bf0/R/DEB.R#L783C1-L786C61> code or the ectotherm Fortran code <https://github.com/mrke/NicheMapR/blob/db4c502f32fb2e316aaee40d5ae36402c7512bf0/src/DEB.f#L954C1-L977C12> and you may find the reason.
All the best,
Mike

